      "text": "APIs / Interfaces\n\n1. POST /student\n2. DELETE /student/{studentId}\n3. PUT /student/{studentId}\n4. GET /student/{studentId}\n\n\n5. POST /books\n6. GET /books/{bookName} -- Better to support other filters as well\n7. DELETE /books/{bookId} -- \n8. PUT /books/{bookId}\n\n\n9. POST /orders {bookId: ...  }\n10 GET /orders -- Filtered API where student can search their orders basis type of order, or on a specific book etc.\n\nOut of scope\n\n11. DELETE /orders/{orderId}\n\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "APIs / Interfaces\n\n1. POST /student\n2. DELETE /student/{studentId}\n3. PUT /student/{studentId}\n4. GET /student/{studentId}\n\n\n5. POST /books\n6. GET /books/{bookName} -- Better to support other filters as well\n7. DELETE /books/{bookId} -- \n8. PUT /books/{bookId}\n\n\n9. POST /orders {bookId: ...  }\n10 GET /orders -- Filtered API where student can search their orders basis type of order, or on a specific book etc.\n\nOut of scope\n\n11. DELETE /orders/{orderId}\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
